  "details": "Sometimes the world where a friend is staying is not updated.\nThis can cause a user to move to a world to visit a friend, only to find that the friend has already moved to another world and is no longer in that world.\nBy adding a reload button, it will be possible to see the latest friend's location.\nI have had many experiences of joining a friend's world only to find that the friend has already been moved to another world.\nPlease add a reload button so that the latest friend's location is always shown.\nThank you very much.",
